        <item>
            <title>1.0.70</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Package tracking.</strong> Shipping emails with a UPS, FedEx, USPS, DHL or Amazon tracking number now show it at the top, with <strong>Track</strong> and <strong>Copy</strong> buttons. The number is found on your Mac. The carrier is only contacted if you click Track.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
